{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's one thing to compose fascinating stories with unusual characters, but it's quite another to encounter them in real life! The aspiring writer Kosmeya worked on his manuscript for a whole year, but a bad memory, washed-out roads and a creepy forest turned the journey to the Festival of Words into a real adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The hero will have to meet a new friend, escape from the witch's curse, get out of the forest, and most importantly, have time to present his work to the jury at the most important writing competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get to know a kind and touching story about not giving up and that your dream will definitely come true. Test your attentiveness in a mini-game of find objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a08 chapters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0colorful drawing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0hidden object game</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2836660?t=1760954326","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2836660?t=1760954326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836660/16d4d11bcee79eb2a0f969d76d8ca4a848233323/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760954326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836660/16d4d11bcee79eb2a0f969d76d8ca4a848233323/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760954326","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's one thing to compose fascinating storie